*****************************DELINQUENCY SCALE ITEMS (WAVE 3).
*Q: In the past 12 months, how often did you [delinquent behavior]?
*   8 items used at Wave 3 per Powell et al. (2010) and dichotomized each item.

***check frequencies for zeros.
